// ONE contract). Hand-authored clean proto-SSOT (decision #89, _arc.md
// principles 1/2/11).
//
// The shape:
//   - ONE service over THREE scopes (SPACE / ACCOUNT / RUNTIME). The scope is an
//     explicit discriminant on every request, not three separate services.
//   - typed SettingList / Setting reads, NOT the opaque JsonResponse envelope.
//   - the crate owns its own `Setting` message (one contract per boundary) — no
//     shared types.proto `SettingValue` return.
//   - event-sourced: `Set` authors a `settings.changed` event in the chosen
//     scope; the per-scope projection is the read model `Get`/`List` read.
//   - `Watch` streaming the shared `WatchEvent` is THE reactive surface (mirrors
